      "title": "Add support for OPCM v2 to packages other than `op-deployer`",
      "author": "0xiamflux",
      "number": 18942,
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/optimism",
      "body": "Work is currently underway in `op-deployer` to provide full support for OPCM v2. While these commands are now functional within `op-deployer`, the changes also impact other packages. Currently, we’ve implemented minimal updates to those packages, essentially adding values that ensure they continue to behave as if they only support OPCM v1. This issue tracks the remaining work required to bring those packages up to date.",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-26T20:12:59Z",
      "closedAt": null,
      "state": "OPEN",
      "commentCount": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "I_kwDODjvEJM7cO5pZ",
      "title": "Remove `SystemConfig::isCustomGasToken` override allowance for OPCMv2",
      "author": "0xiamflux",
      "number": 18502,
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/optimism",
      "body": "OPCMv2 currently has an allowance that permits an override for the value of `SystemConfig::isCustomGasToken`. This is required until U18 ships when `isCustomGasToken` will be available on the SystemConfig and needs to be removed afterward.",
